# This is a simple program which produces a "graph" with one file "resource" in
# it. The graph is static and does not change shape over time.
#
# Run with: mgmt run --tmp-prefix lang 00-hello-world.mcl

file "/tmp/mgmt-hello-world" {
	content => "welcome to the workshop from @purpleidea\n",
	state => $const.res.file.state.exists,
}

# What happens when you rm the /tmp/mgmt-hello-world file while mgmt is running?
# You can press ^C to exit the running program.
#
# If you'd like more detailed informations and background on the theory, follow
# the documentation guide in parallel: https://mgmtconfig.com/docs/guide/
